@PrometheusStock.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5136

### Health — liveness probe
GET {{PrometheusStock.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Intraday daily summary for a symbol
GET {{PrometheusStock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stocks/TSLA/intraday
Accept: application/json

### Unknown symbol — 404 problem+json
GET {{PrometheusStock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stocks/NOTAREALSYMBOLXYZ/intraday
Accept: application/json

### Malformed symbol — 400 problem+json
GET {{PrometheusStock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/stocks/@@@/intraday
Accept: application/json
